Description:It is your first main phase. You control Horned Turtle (1/4) and an untapped Plateau (taps for R or W), with one blue mana floating. You have Twisted Image, Iron Will and Bull Rush in hand. The opponent is at 5 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-layers-switch-last | Power/toughness switching applies in layer 7d, after every other P/T change whatever the timestamps (CR 613.4d, 613.7): Iron Will plus Twisted Image makes the Turtle 1/8 switched to 8/1 in either order; Bull Rush after the switch does not give 6/1 as a naive reading says, the Turtle is 3/4 switched to 4/3 and deals 4
